    <body>
      <p source="#source-475-525"><seg source="#source-475-487">わが思ふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-487-502"><rb>女</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-502-525">ありやなしや。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-525-553"><seg source="#source-525-553">まよわしきかな。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-553-621"><seg source="#source-553-583">夕暮の窓にもたれて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-583-607"><rb>蒼白</rb><rt>あをじろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-607-621">き息ふく</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-621-662"><seg source="#source-621-662">われも、またありやなしや。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-662-691"><seg source="#source-662-691">あな、うたがわし。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-691-741"><seg source="#source-691-741">蚊のなく声を、君がかなしき唄とや</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-741-755"><seg source="#source-741-755">きかむ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-755-826"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-755-779"><rb>柔風</rb><rt>なよかぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-779-826">の木の葉にすがる、たわふれを、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-826-869"><seg source="#source-826-869">君が鬢のほつれとやきかむ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-869-907"><seg source="#source-869-907">淋しき夕べの鐘もきこゆ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-907-966"><seg source="#source-907-934">森のかなた、君住む</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-934-949"><rb>墓</rb><rt>ほと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-949-966">の頭りにや</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-966-982"><seg source="#source-966-982">あらむ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-982-1032"><seg source="#source-982-1032">今なり、われは独りさ迷ひゆかむ！</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1032-1073"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1032-1047"><rb>夕</rb><rt>ゆふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1047-1073">べの鐘をしたひて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1073-1115"><seg source="#source-1073-1091">その音に耳を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1091-1106"><rb>静</rb><rt>しづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1106-1115">めて。</seg></p>
    </body>
